        "answer": {
          "short": "$(x-a)^2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x+a)^2-4ax&=x^2+2ax+a^2-4ax\\\\(x+a)^2-4ax&=x^2-2ax+a^2\\\\(x+a)^2-4ax&=(x-a)^2\\end{align*}$$",
